WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.676
BOTH OF THEIR STORIES DIVERGE.

00:00:02.675 --> 00:00:05.211
I LOOK FORWARD TO YOUR NEXT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.578
ARTICLE AND I'LL TALK TO YOU

00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:06.379
SOON.

00:00:05.711 --> 00:00:08.981
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:06.512 --> 00:00:10.616
&gt;&gt; Brian: MEANWHILE, THE MEMO

00:00:09.115 --> 00:00:11.150
NEWS SPARKED A TWITTER RESPONSE

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.785
FROM THE PRESIDENT.

00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:21.561
I DIDN'T EVEN KNOW HE HAD A

00:00:12.919 --> 00:00:22.762
TWITTER ACCOUNT.

00:00:21.694 --> 00:00:25.398
JONATHAN TURLEY AS A LAWYER.

00:00:22.895 --> 00:00:27.733
HE KNOWS THE ANSWER TO THAT.

00:00:25.531 --> 00:00:28.367
PROFESSIONAL OF CONSTITUTIONAL

00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:30.069
LAW AT GEORGE WASHINGTON

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:32.004
UNIVERSITY, OVER $70,000 A YEAR,

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:33.172
I LOOKED AT THAT WAY THEY DON'T

00:00:32.138 --> 00:00:33.773
OFFER MUCH AID.

00:00:33.306 --> 00:00:35.208
&gt;&gt; IT'S A DEAL.

00:00:33.906 --> 00:00:37.310
&gt;&gt; Brian: YOU ARE THERE SO IT

00:00:35.341 --> 00:00:39.078
MAKES IT WORTH IT.

00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:40.780
WHAT DO WE LEARN NOW, JONATHAN,

00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:42.715
THAT WE DIDN'T KNOW BEFORE THIS

00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:43.316
BOOK PUBLISHED THAT HAS YOU

00:00:42.849 --> 00:00:45.384
REALLY INTRIGUED?

00:00:43.449 --> 00:00:46.619
&gt;&gt; IT CONFIRMS MANY THINGS THAT

00:00:45.518 --> 00:00:50.323
SOME OF US HAVE BEEN SAYING.

00:00:46.752 --> 00:00:52.291
FOR OVER A YEAR, YOU'VE HAD MANY

00:00:50.456 --> 00:00:54.327
SUPPORTERS SAYING THINGS THAT I

00:00:52.425 --> 00:00:55.761
THINK ARE FACIALLY SIMPLY

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.529
UNSUPPORTABLE.

00:00:55.895 --> 00:00:58.164
ONE OF THEM IS THAT THESE WERE

00:00:56.662 --> 00:00:59.966
SOME TYPE OF PERSONAL DIARY,

00:00:58.297 --> 00:01:00.766
THAT THEY WERE HIS PERSONAL

00:01:00.099 --> 00:01:03.169
NOTES.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.903
HE CONTINUES TO MAINTAIN MATCH.

00:01:03.302 --> 00:01:06.739
AND THAT IS FACIALLY RIDICULOUS.

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.140
IF YOU LOOK AT THE MEMOS, THEY

00:01:06.873 --> 00:01:09.509
ARE NOT TO HIM, THEY ARE NOT MY

00:01:08.274 --> 00:01:11.777
MOST OF THE FILE, THEY ARE MEMOS

00:01:09.642 --> 00:01:13.546
TO OTHER FBI OFFICIALS.

00:01:11.911 --> 00:01:15.448
HE IS ACTUALLY STATING IN ONE OF

00:01:13.679 --> 00:01:17.550
THE MEMOS HOW HE WANTS TO DO THE

00:01:15.581 --> 00:01:19.352
PRELIMINARY CLASSIFICATION AND

00:01:17.683 --> 00:01:20.553
GIVING IT TO THESE OTHER

00:01:19.485 --> 00:01:23.155
OFFICIALS FOR THEIR INPUT.

00:01:20.686 --> 00:01:25.091
THESE ARE NOT PERSONAL RECORDS.

00:01:23.289 --> 00:01:26.392
ALSO, THE FBI ITSELF HAS SAID,

00:01:25.224 --> 00:01:28.394
THIS IS FBI MATERIAL.

00:01:26.526 --> 00:01:30.963
SO YOU HAVE SOMEONE WHO WAS

00:01:28.528 --> 00:01:31.964
FIRED AS THE DIRECTOR OF THE

00:01:31.097 --> 00:01:35.968
FBI, REMOVING SEVEN DOCUMENTS

00:01:32.098 --> 00:01:37.303
FROM THE FBI, FOUR OF WHICH WERE

00:01:36.102 --> 00:01:38.004
DEEMED TO HAVE CLASSIFIED

00:01:37.436 --> 00:01:39.572
INFORMATION, AND THEN GIVING

00:01:38.137 --> 00:01:41.974
THEM TO A FRIEND FOR THE PURPOSE

00:01:39.705 --> 00:01:43.609
OF LICKING THEM TO THE MEDIA.

00:01:42.108 --> 00:01:44.377
THAT IS A VERY SERIOUS SET OF

00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:46.913
FACTS.

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.214
IT DOESN'T EXACTLY SPEAK TO THE

00:01:47.046 --> 00:01:52.418
ETHICAL LEADERSHIP MODEL THAT

00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:53.119
COMEY HAS BEEN A PROPONENT OF.

00:01:52.552 --> 00:01:54.387
&gt;&gt; Brian: ONE PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:01:53.252 --> 00:01:55.221
SINCE THERE IS THE BUSINESSMAN

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.890
TURNED BRAND-NEW POLITICIAN AND

00:01:55.354 --> 00:01:58.524
SAYS, WHAT IS GOING ON WITH

00:01:58.024 --> 00:02:02.962
COMEY?

00:01:58.658 --> 00:02:04.797
WHAT'S GOING ON WITH McCABE?

00:02:03.095 --> 00:02:06.165
PETER STRZOK, LISA PAGE.

00:02:04.931 --> 00:02:08.367
YES, YES, YES, AND YES.

00:02:06.299 --> 00:02:08.668
HIS INSTINCTS WERE RIGHT ON

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:10.503
THIS!

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:12.538
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT IT WOULDN'T

00:02:10.636 --> 00:02:13.639
COMES TO COMEY, MANY OF THE

00:02:12.672 --> 00:02:15.374
CRITICISMS HAVE BEEN BORNE OUT,

00:02:13.773 --> 00:02:16.342
AS WITH McCABE.

00:02:15.508 --> 00:02:17.543
NOT THAT THE PRESIDENT HASN'T

00:02:16.475 --> 00:02:19.011
MADE HIS OWN MISTAKES BUT HE HAS

00:02:17.677 --> 00:02:21.581
BEEN BLESSED BY THE CRITICS THAT

00:02:19.145 --> 00:02:23.149
HE HAS INHERITED.

00:02:21.714 --> 00:02:27.553
I THINK WITH REGARD TO McCABE,

